<p>Pure Virtual C++ is back! For the 7th year running, we&#8217;re hosting a free, one-day virtual conference for the whole C++ community. Whether you joined us back in 2020 when we first launched or you&#8217;re discovering the event for the first time, we&#8217;d love to have you.</p>
<p><strong>Mark your calendar: Tuesday, July 21, 2026, starting at 16:00 UTC (9:00 AM in Seattle/Los Angeles, 1:00 PM in Buenos Aires, 12:00 AM in Hong Kong).</strong> The conference runs approximately 2 hours and will be streamed live on both YouTube and Twitch, so you can watch from anywhere in the world.</p>
